  "open_questions": [
    "The two TDS (DL2-13819.pdf 'TDS OF RF6066' and DL2-15451.pdf) carry no date, so the order of revisions cannot be determined. Density, KV100, TBN, Zn and Ca differ between documents (see conflicts) and are left null. DL2-13819.pdf matches the 2020 SDS (density 990, TBN 106); DL2-15451.pdf matches the 2021 SDS (density 0.988, 185 mm²/s), which suggests DL2-15451.pdf is the later TDS, but no date is printed.",
    "Supplier spelled 'Xinxiang Richuful Lube Additive Co. Ltd.' in SDS DL2-13820.pdf p.1 and 'Xinxiang Richful Lube Additive Co., Ltd.' in SDS DL2-15831.pdf p.1.",
    "DL2-15831.pdf (SDS 2021): body text is image/vector graphics; read visually from page renders.",
    "Old Product_JSON mixed values from DL2-15451.pdf and DL2-13819.pdf without flagging the differences.",
    "Claim type 'recommended' from the 'Recommended Treat Rate' tables. Storage/blending limits differ between the two TDS (45/65 ℃ vs 50/60 ℃)."
